### Collected dumps — real cluster data, never committed ###
# A dump carries index names, template field names, node names and capacity.
# README says to review one before it leaves a controlled environment; this is
# what stops it leaving by accident.
result/
# collect writes here by default when run from the repository root
oss-check-*.tar.gz
